// "Starfall Sectors" — StarCraft II (Legacy of the Void) rules with three factions, each with its own build mode.
// Guild (Protoss): probes warp structures in and walk on; structures need the power field of a pylon (6.5 cells) to be
// placed and to work; units and structures have shields that soak damage first and recharge after 10 s.
// Swarm (Zerg): drones morph into structures; hatcheries make larva (3 at most, one per 11 s), zerglings come in pairs,
// everything regenerates, structures need creep. Legion (Terran): SCVs build; barracks and factory take add-ons
// (tech lab: marauders / siege tanks; reactor: two marines at once). Damage = attack + bonus vs attribute (armored,
// light, ...) - armor, at least 0.5. Minerals: 8 patches per base (1800 / 900), one worker per patch at a time,
// 5 a trip; gas: 4 a trip from a refinery on the geyser. Start: 12 workers, 50 minerals. Low ground can't see up.
// Not yet here (engine plan): detection and cloak, burrow, bunkers, siege mode, queen larva inject, air units.
